#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials instead of manually entering them"
msgstr ""
"Guarda tus credenciales de acceso en lugar de introducirlas manualmente"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials"
msgstr "Guardar tus credenciales de acceso"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Save your login credentials {#save-your-login-credentials}"
msgstr "Guardar tus credenciales de acceso {#save-your-login-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are working in a trusted Python environment (such as on a personal "
"laptop or workstation), you can use the `save_account()` method to save your"
" credentials locally, then use them to initialize the service.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si trabajas en un entorno Python de confianza (como tu laptop personal o una"
" estación de trabajo), puedes usar el método `save_account()` para guardar "
"tus credenciales localmente y luego usarlas para inicializar el servicio.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"  * If you are using a public computer or other untrusted environment, follow the instructions in [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) instead.\n"
"  * Follow [these instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) if you want to connect by using the REST API instead of using Qiskit.\n"
"  * If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to configure your firewall to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notas\">\n"
"      * Si usas una computadora pública u otro entorno no confiable, sigue en su lugar las instrucciones de [Inicializar el servicio en un entorno no confiable](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
"      * Sigue [estas instrucciones](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) si quieres conectarte mediante la API REST en lugar de usar Qiskit.\n"
"      * Si es necesario, usa [esta información](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) para configurar tu firewall y habilitar el acceso a los endpoints de la API de IBM Quantum.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Antes de empezar {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Ensure you are working in an active Python environment with the [Qiskit SDK "
"and Qiskit Runtime installed](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de estar trabajando en un entorno Python activo con el [SDK de "
"Qiskit y Qiskit Runtime instalados](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Activate the Python virtual environment and run Python in your virtual "
"environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Activa el entorno virtual de Python y ejecuta Python dentro de ese "
"entorno.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr ""
"Inicia sesión en [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"find-credentials\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"find-credentials\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access credentials {#find-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Encontrar tus credenciales de acceso {#find-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Make sure that the correct account and region are selected in the account "
"switcher in the header.\n"
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que la cuenta y la región correctas estén seleccionadas en el "
"selector de cuentas del encabezado.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Find your API key. From the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), "
"create your API key, then copy it to a secure location so you can use it for"
" authentication. Note that you can use the same API key to connect to any "
"region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Encuentra tu clave de API. Desde el [panel de "
"control](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), crea tu clave de API, luego "
"cópiala en un lugar seguro para poder usarla en la autenticación. Ten en "
"cuenta que puedes usar la misma clave de API para conectarte a cualquier "
"región.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Optional: Find the instance you want to use from the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Hover over its "
"CRN, click the icon to copy it, then save it in a secure location so you can"
" use it to identify the instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Opcional: Encuentra la instancia que quieres usar desde la página "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Pasa el cursor sobre "
"su CRN, haz clic en el ícono para copiarlo y guárdalo en un lugar seguro "
"para poder identificar la instancia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Save your access credentials {#save-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Guardar tus credenciales de acceso {#save-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Save your credentials by running the appropriate code once per account you "
"want to save. After saving your credentials, load them by following the "
"steps in [Initialize the Qiskit Runtime service](/guides/initialize-"
"account).\n"
msgstr ""
"Guarda tus credenciales ejecutando el código apropiado una vez por cada "
"cuenta que quieras guardar. Después de guardarlas, cárgalas siguiendo los "
"pasos en [Inicializar el servicio Qiskit Runtime.](/guides/initialize-"
"account)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"save-instance\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"save-instance\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Save credentials that access a specific instance: {#save-credentials-that-"
"access-a-specific-instance}"
msgstr ""
"Guardar credenciales que acceden a una instancia específica: {#save-"
"credentials-that-access-a-specific-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have multiple instances and want to easily tell Qiskit Runtime which "
"instance to use, save credentials that include an instance CRN.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si tienes varias instancias y quieres indicarle fácilmente a Qiskit Runtime "
"cuál usar, guarda credenciales que incluyan el CRN de una instancia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your-api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your-api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Save credentials for automatic instance selection: {#save-credentials-for-"
"automatic-instance-selection}"
msgstr ""
"Guardar credenciales para la selección automática de instancia: {#save-"
"credentials-for-automatic-instance-selection}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you don't provide an instance CRN and pass these credentials to Qiskit "
"Runtime, an appropriate instance will be chosen for you, based on the "
"specified options.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si no proporcionas un CRN de instancia y pasas estas credenciales a Qiskit "
"Runtime, se elegirá automáticamente una instancia adecuada según las "
"opciones especificadas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your=api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<instance-to-use>\", # Optional\n"
"      plans_preference=\"<plan_types>\", # Optional\n"
"      region=\"<region>\", # Optional\n"
"      tags=\"<instance-tags>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    QiskitRuntimeService.save_account(\n"
"      # For `token`, use the 44-character API_KEY you created \n"
"      # and saved from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard:\n"
"      token=\"<your=api-key>\", \n"
"      name=\"<account-name>\", # Optional\n"
"      instance=\"<instance-to-use>\", # Optional\n"
"      plans_preference=\"<plan_types>\", # Optional\n"
"      region=\"<region>\", # Optional\n"
"      tags=\"<instance-tags>\", # Optional\n"
"      set_as_default=True, # Optional\n"
"      overwrite=True, # Optional\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example 2 {#example-2}"
msgstr "Ejemplo 2 {#example-2}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example saves credentials for automatic instance selection.  Qiskit "
"Runtime will only look at premium instances in the EU region that are "
"available to the account. These credentials become the new default.\n"
msgstr ""
"Este ejemplo guarda credenciales para la selección automática de instancia. "
"Qiskit Runtime solo considerará las instancias premium en la región de la UE"
" disponibles para la cuenta. Estas credenciales se convierten en las nuevas "
"predeterminadas.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View saved credentials {#view-saved-credentials}"
msgstr "Ver las credenciales guardadas {#view-saved-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To view all credentials that you have saved, run `service.saved_accounts()`."
"  Note that if you saved default credentials and didn't name them, they are "
"named `default-ibm-quantum-platform`. If you did name your default "
"credentials, you will see `\"is_default_account\": true` in the output.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para ver todas las credenciales que has guardado, ejecuta "
"`service.saved_accounts()`. Ten en cuenta que si guardaste credenciales "
"predeterminadas sin asignarles un nombre, se llamarán `default-ibm-quantum-"
"platform`. Si les asignaste un nombre, verás `\"is_default_account\": true` "
"en la salida.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Considerations {#considerations}"
msgstr "Consideraciones {#considerations}"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are saving multiple accounts, use the `name` parameter to "
"differentiate them.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si vas a guardar varias cuentas, usa el parámetro `name` para "
"diferenciarlas.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Credentials are saved to `$HOME/.qiskit/qiskit-ibm.json`.  Do not manually "
"edit this file.\n"
msgstr ""
"Las credenciales se guardan en `$HOME/.qiskit/qiskit-ibm.json`. No edites "
"este archivo manualmente.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you don't save your credentials, you must specify them every time you "
"start a new session (instantiate the Qiskit Runtime service).\n"
msgstr ""
"Si no guardas tus credenciales, deberás especificarlas cada vez que inicies "
"una nueva sesión (al instanciar el servicio Qiskit Runtime).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you manually specify your credentials, a saved account will not be "
"used.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si especificas tus credenciales manualmente, no se usará ninguna cuenta "
"guardada.\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos pasos {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
